# Airbender Ascension: "At the beginning of your end step, if this enchantment has four or more quest counters on it ..." is an
# intervening "if" (CR 603.4): with only three counters it does not trigger at all, so no target is asked for and nothing
# is flickered. Three Ornithopters enter on turn 1; at the end step nothing is put on the stack (no target is asked for): the
# enchantment has three counters, not the four a flicker (a creature entering again) would make.

